# Patch author identity

When creating or editing any project-owned `*.patch` (especially under `meta-local/`):

- Use **From:** and **Signed-off-by:** as `Max Leontev <maxleontev@gmail.com>`.
- Never use `max@localhost` or other placeholder emails.
- Do not rewrite author headers in upstream layers (`poky/`, `meta-sunxi/`, `meta-arm/`, …) unless the user asks.

```diff
-From: Max <max@localhost>
-Signed-off-by: Max <max@localhost>
+From: Max Leontev <maxleontev@gmail.com>
+Signed-off-by: Max Leontev <maxleontev@gmail.com>
```
